      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سِفَارَةٌ</span></b>  an inf. n. of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَفَرَ</span> in the phrase <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَفَرَ بَيْنَ</span>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">القَوْمِ</span> [q. v.]. (S, Mgh, Msb, K.) [And hence,
The <i>office of the</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَفِير</span> (q. v.). See also De Sacy's
Chrest. Ar., sec. ed., i. 126 and 172: and Quatremère's Hist. des Sultans Mamlouks, i. 193.] ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2- 
